    </a>
    <a class="tools-card" href="/app/health-check/">
      <h2 class="tools-card__title">Health check</h2>
      <p>Deterministic scans for orphaned references, broken templates, future-dated transactions.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="tools-card" href="/app/audit-log/">
      <h2 class="tools-card__title">Audit log</h2>
