    </a>
    <a class="tools-card" href="/app/trash/">
      <h2 class="tools-card__title">Trash</h2>
      <p>Deleted transactions wait 30 days before purging — restore or empty here.</p>
    </a>

    {# Workflow accelerators #}
    <a class="tools-card" href="/app/accounts/">
      <h2 class="tools-card__title">Reconcile</h2>
      <p>Open Accounts and pick the row's kebab menu → Reconcile to match the cleared balance to your statement.</p>
